Package: blt
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Lineage Tracing (BLT)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Leda", "Liang", email = "ledal@stanford.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Mackenzie", "Simper", role = "aut"),
    person("Julia", "Palacios", role = "aut"))
Description: Simulation and inference for CRISPR based lineage tracing under a
    finite alleles model of editing. Builds the mutation state space and rate
    matrices for a barcode of adjacent cut sites, simulates allele data along a
    tree, and evaluates the likelihood and its gradient for a fixed topology.
    Estimates mutation rates, coalescent times under the bounded coalescent,
    and searches over tree topologies by simulated annealing.
